## 🛠️ Firestore Use Cases

Here are some production-grade ideas:

| Use Case | Description | Key Features |
|----------|-------------|--------------|
| 💬 Chat Applications | Real-time messaging between users | Message sync, offline support |
| ✅ Task Managers | Shared boards with role-based access | Real-time updates, permissions |
| 📊 Admin Dashboards | Live analytics and monitoring | Real-time charts, filtering |
| 🧑‍🤝‍🧑 Collaborative Tools | Multi-user editing and sharing | Conflict resolution, presence |

